		{
			"id": "nDgdUk-rVhGzmfYRj",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 21, DX 10, IQ 6, HT 11, HP 23, WILL 10, PER 6, FP 11, SPEED 5.25, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nnkE5QlMJPjv5pQ4D",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 48 (offense 24, protection 24), threat tier standard, appearing 2."
		},
