			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/minotaur-skeleton.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nnHGno4hhE0iEWut8",
			"text": "Independent build total: 236 points of racial traits plus 2 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "n2RRXE9hGeqmgfeOC",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Minotaur Skeleton (SRD 5.1). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nGSfwVvPhZkcBgwRH",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "ng0QdPW8cUkwVTJBw",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 90 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nGP4IadRkefrdIQLm",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nAXpdCZZNlzOg2GFq",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "ni7Ok9Fs1_k3ZchWu",
			"text": "The living creature's mass drops to bone; SM +1 for the frame's height."
